{"product_id":"dorothy-must-die","title":"Dorothy Must Die","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe New York Times bestselling first book in a dark new series that reimagines the Oz saga, from debut author Danielle Paige.I didn't ask for any of this. I didn't ask to be some kind of hero. But when your whole life gets swept up by a tornado‰ÛÓtaking you with it‰ÛÓyou have no choice but to go along, you know?Sure, I've read the books. I've seen the movies. I know the song about the rainbow and the happy little blue birds. But I never expected Oz to look like this. To be a place where Good Witches can't be trusted, Wicked Witches may just be the good guys, and winged monkeys can be executed for acts of rebellion. There's still a road of yellow brick‰ÛÓbut even that's crumbling.What happened? Dorothy. They say she found a way to come back to Oz. They say she seized power and the power went to her head. And now no one is safe.My name is Amy Gumm‰ÛÓand I'm the other girl from Kansas. I've been recruited by the Revolutionary Order of the Wicked. I've been trained to fight. And I have a mission: Remove the Tin Woodman's heart. Steal the Scarecrow's brain. Take the Lion's courage. And‰ÛÓDorothy must die.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Danielle Paige\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780062347046\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 464\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45233134370969,"sku":"9RD9780062347046","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67dc1c46c9bbd_Dorothy_20Must_20Die_20Danielle_20Paige_20_1.jpg?v=1752150911","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/dorothy-must-die","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}